                  <div class="region region-content">
      <div id="block-speedway-page-title" class="container-xl readable block block-core block-page-title-block clearfix">
  
    
      
  <h1><span>Academic Calendar Archive</span>
</h1>


  </div>
<div id="block-speedway-main-page-content" class="block block-system block-system-main-block clearfix">
  
    
      <article class="node node--type-utexas-flex-page node--view-mode-full">

  
    

  
  <div class="node__content">
    


<div  class="section-wrapper">
    <div  class="layout layout--utexas-onecol readable container-xl">
                <div  class="layout__region layout__region--main">
          <div class="block-bundle-basic block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockbasic clearfix">
  
    
      
            <div class="ut-copy field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The academic calendar first went <strong>online</strong> in 1996.</p><table class="table"><tbody><tr><td><h2>2020's</h2></td></tr><tr><td><p><a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/25-26"><strong>2025-2026</strong></a></p><p><a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/24-25"><strong>2024-2025</strong></a></p><p><a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/23-24" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="4920f3d9-be8f-46aa-97d4-7da205d70f02" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="2023 - 2024 Academic Calendar"><strong>2023-2024</strong></a></p><p><a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/22-23" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="906f6adf-b182-49a1-8acc-57977731c0e6" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Academic Calendar 2022 - 2023"><strong>2022-2023</strong></a></p><p><a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/21-22"><strong>21-22</strong>&nbsp;long</a>&nbsp;| <a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/22summer" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="d0c92f73-1449-4ca6-b572-f2c53ee0c799" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Summer Session 2022"><strong>22</strong> summer</a></p><p><a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/20-21"><strong>20-21</strong>&nbsp;long</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/21summer"><strong>21</strong>&nbsp;summer</a></p></td></tr><tr><td><h2>2010's</h2></td></tr><tr><td><p><a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/19-20"><strong>19-20</strong>&nbsp;long</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/20summer"><strong>20</strong>&nbsp;summer</a></p><p><a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/18-19"><strong>18-19</strong>&nbsp;long</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/19summer"><strong>19</strong>&nbsp;summer</a></p><p><a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/calendars/17-18"><st